OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged over hit and run which
OL,4,Aleft pedestrian critically injured
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged in connection
OL,7,Fwith a hit and run in Dundee which left
OL,8,Fa pedestrian in a critical condition.
OL,10,FThe 54-year-old remains seriously
OL,11,Finjured in hospital after being struck
OL,12,Fby a dark-coloured hatchback on Arran
OL,13,FDrive, at about 19:50 on 5 November.
OL,15,FPolice launched an appeal for
OL,16,Finformation after the vehicle failed to
OL,17,Fstop at the scene.
OL,19,FA 45-year-old man has since been
OL,20,Farrested and charged and is scheduled
OL,21,Fto appear at Dundee Sheriff Court on
OL,22,FMonday.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
